  "discordPostHtml": "<p>Adds a new faction called <em>the Boundless</em>, ships to go along with them, and campaign-level features such as a new storyline and ability.</p><p>The faction inhabits two new star systems to the Southeast of the core worlds. Enjoy exploring the new worlds! This mod is still early in development, so it's a little thin on features as-of-yet, but I plan to add much and more. More new ships, weapons, and expansions to the storyline. If you need a hint as to how to start the story: head to the system called Kato. <strong><em>Requires MagicLib and LazyLib.</em></strong></p><p>Download: <a href=\"https://github.com/JohnShmo/Project_ItCameFromBeyond/releases/latest/download/ItCameFromBeyond.zip\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/JohnShmo/Project_ItCameFromBeyond/releases/latest/download/ItCameFromBeyond.zip</a><br>Forum Thread: <a href=\"https://fractalsoftworks.com/forum/index.php?topic=30923.0\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://fractalsoftworks.com/forum/index.php?topic=30923.0</a></p>",
